s with the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight themed Logbooks with their own missions and rewards, plus a daily Mission for bonus XP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738090/extras/a40c300f7ceddd9d4e329301fe88ebce.poster.avif?t=1787086382\" width=1170 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738090/extras/a40c300f7ceddd9d4e329301fe88ebce.webm?t=1787086382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738090/extras/a40c300f7ceddd9d4e329301fe88ebce.mp4?t=1787086382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Your inventory is a poker hand. Match the suits on your guns to unlock perks in a third-person Wild West battle royale: fight from the saddle, win a showdown for your Second Chance, and ride the train to stay ahead of the Calamity.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738090/72097554f26ab5aafdbcd059bc7915f4ab545a5a/header.jpg?t=1787086382", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738090/c611eb68ceddf11ee3bb9aa3d8e7f023593578d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787086382", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/738090/c611eb68ceddf11ee3bb9aa3d8e7f023593578d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787086382", "website": "https://grit.gg/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<b